eparateColor` + `Translate` + `CombineColor` masked by off-focus distance (`Mist` / `|Z - focus|` away from `V5_CamFocus`, forced `0` on hero car, spiked during `f=788..790` \\u0026 `f=1601..1603` portal cuts!).\\n     * **Paper Grain + High-Speed Radial Border Speed-Lines (`v \\u003e 290 km/h`) + Impact Frame Duotone**.\\n2) `pipeline/v6_sv_stills.py` \\u0026 `pipeline/render_v6_sv.py`:\\n   - Render all **26 stylized 1080p stills** (`renders_v6/stills/shot_01_*.jpg`..`shot_26_*.jpg`) + `contact_sheet_v6.jpg` + a genuine **Spider-Verse Comic-Book Multi-Panel Page Poster** (`renders_v6/stills/comic_page_sheet.jpg` with dynamic angled/asymmetric comic panel borders, crisp white gutters, halftone accents, and issue header!).\\n   - Build `pipeline/render_v6_sv.py` (supports `--range START-END --outdir DIR` and full `--all` 2161f mode).\\n   - Render the **3× 4-second (96 frames each = 288 frames total) 1080p 24fps showcase clips**:\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 61..156`** (`S01_RearChase -\\u003e S02_Onboard` beat cut);\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 1290..1385`** (`S15_OrbitCopse -\\u003e S16_ChaseCopse` watercolor sweep);\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 1650..1745`** (`S19_Onboard3 331km/h -\\u003e S20_StoweTele + f=1698..1699 Impact Frame`).\\n3) Wait (`swarm_wait`) until `@env-2` finishes `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` before running the final build \\u0026 renders (you can write all scripts now!). Once rendered \\u0026 PIL-verified, write `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md` + update `README.md`, and hand off to `@sfx`!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:21:47\",\"request_id\":\"ebb303b8-1629-4949-a435-be2944b86a74\"}],\"head\":26}"}
